Below are the columns that matter for rebuilding the requested ­navigation flow together with the most typical ways we are going to use them.

• `event_date` : date filter – keep only events for 20210128  
• `user_pseudo_id` : user filter – keep only the visitor '1362228.4966015575'  
• `event_name` : keep only page_view events  
• `event_timestamp` : sort the clicks chronologically  
• `event_params` : extract  ‑
  – `page_title` (the readable title)  
  – `page_location` (the full URL, used for PDP / PLP detection)  

The rest of the columns are not needed for this specific task.

